%% Rich Picture 02 — Current problem situation and desired change
%% Updated: 2026-07-27.
%% Level: High.
%% Evidence status: Implemented + Partial; future capability is explicitly marked.
%% Reader intent: Show why stakeholders need Suar and why simple task/rating software is insufficient.
%% Keep reason: problem, intervention, and outcome regions are required parts of one rich-picture change narrative.
%% Sources: capability model v6 sections 1-6 and 24-26; SRS functional requirements.

flowchart LR
    subgraph current["Current problem situation"]
        direction TB
        P1["📋 Work context is scattered<br/>outcomes are hard to compare"]
        P2["🗣️ Claims and reviewed evidence mix<br/>equal label, unequal trust"]
        P3["🔎 Scores and matches hide context<br/>confidence, staleness, disputes"]
        P1 ~~~ P2 ~~~ P3
    end

    subgraph change["SUAR intervention"]
        direction TB
        C1["1  Structure work context<br/>requirements • target • assessment ceiling"]
        C2["2  Link evidence to review<br/>submission • rubric • confidence • rationale"]
        C3["3  Govern conclusions<br/>quorum • dispute • fraud checks • audit"]
        C4["4  Publish capability signal<br/>verified evidence separate from claims"]
        C1 --> C2 --> C3 --> C4
    end

    subgraph outcomes["Desired outcomes"]
        direction TB
        O1["✅ Work becomes portable,<br/>traceable evidence"]
        O2["✅ Profile explains<br/>what is verified and why"]
        O3["🟡 Explainable matching<br/>Partial — full model planned"]
        O1 ~~~ O2 ~~~ O3
    end

    current -->|"Contributor: will work become proof?<br/>Manager: who fits this context?<br/>Reviewer/admin: can conclusions be justified?"| change
    change --> outcomes

    CONFLICT1{{"⚡ pressure<br/>fast delivery ↔ rigorous assessment"}}
    CONFLICT2{{"⚡ risk<br/>self-claim ↔ verified conclusion"}}
    CONFLICT3{{"⚡ governance<br/>automation ↔ human accountability"}}
    CONFLICT1 -.-> C1
    CONFLICT1 -.-> C2
    CONFLICT2 -.-> C4
    CONFLICT3 -.-> C3

    classDef pain fill:#FEF2F2,stroke:#DC2626,color:#7F1D1D,stroke-width:2px
    classDef intervention fill:#ECFDF5,stroke:#059669,color:#064E3B,stroke-width:2px
    classDef outcome fill:#F0FDF4,stroke:#16A34A,color:#14532D,stroke-width:2px
    classDef tension fill:#FFF7ED,stroke:#EA580C,color:#7C2D12,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray:5 4
    class P1,P2,P3 pain
    class C1,C2,C3,C4 intervention
    class O1,O2,O3 outcome
    class CONFLICT1,CONFLICT2,CONFLICT3 tension
    style change fill:#F0FDF4,stroke:#16A34A,stroke-width:3px
